    "notes": [
      "GPIO is powered from the on-board 3.3 V rail and fixed at 3.3 V.",
      "GPIO26-29 (ADC-capable) have a reverse diode to IOVDD: input must not exceed IOVDD + ~300 mV.",
      "The datasheet does not state 5 V tolerance, so 5 V into any GPIO is treated as an error."
